### Dodaj novu osobu
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Osoba",
  "number": "123-456789"
}

### Provjeri da je dodata (treba da bude 5 osoba)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons

### Ovo treba da padne sa 400 - ime vec postoji
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arto Hellas",
  "number": "000-000"
}
